The default software license is the Apache 2.0 license
unless the folder contains a specific LICENSE.txt file
or if it was explicitely written in the file.

The full texts of the licenses are in the LICENSES folder.

Some images have a specific license:
- validate.png : https://github.com/google/material-design-icons/blob/master/symbols/web/check/materialsymbolsoutlined/check_24px.svg
  License: Apache License 2.0
  Author: Google / Material Symbols
  The PNG is an enlarged and slightly thickened 24 px raster adaptation of the official `check` SVG.

